{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "box-reveal",
  "title": "盒子揭示",
  "description": "用于内容被色块滑开后显现的揭示入场动画组件。",
  "category": "effect",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "magic-ui"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "color",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "揭示盒子的背景色。",
      "default": "\"#5046e6\""
    },
    {
      "name": "duration",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "揭示动画的持续时间（秒）。",
      "default": "0.5"
    },
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "HTMLAttributes[\"class\"]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "用于自定义样式的额外 CSS 类。",
      "default": "\"\""
    },
    {
      "name": "delay",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "动画开始前的延迟（秒）。",
      "default": "0.25"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "default",
      "description": ""
    }
  ],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "path": "app/components/reborn/examples/box-reveal/BoxRevealDemo.vue",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "落地页标题、段落逐块揭示的首屏排版（可多个实例配不同 duration 形成节奏）。",
    "需要自定义遮罩色块颜色（color）呼应品牌色的入场动画。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "需要模糊淡入而非色块滑开的效果，改用 blur-reveal。",
    "滚动驱动的整段文字揭示，改用 text-reveal。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用，依赖 motion-v。",
    "duration 与 delay 单位为秒（默认 0.5 和 0.25）。",
    "color 是遮罩色块的背景色（默认 #5046e6），不是文字颜色。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    "motion-v"
  ],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add box-reveal"
  },
